# Ad Copy Variants — Greenwich Pizza Initiatives, Philippines 2026

## Overview
Three ad copy variants per initiative, tailored to each persona's primary channel:
1) **Student Combo (₱149)** — TikTok script + Instagram Reel caption  
2) **Flash Sale (4–6 PM, ₱129)** — SMS blast + app push notification  
3) **Kids + Family Bundle (₱179–₱199)** — Facebook post + parent group message

All copy uses exact phrases from the personas, addresses top objections, and includes clear CTAs.

