## Objection-handling variants (A/B test)

### Student Combo (hidden fees objection)

**Variant A:**  
"No hidden fees, student price lang—order na sa app!"

**Variant B:**  
"Free delivery sa student combo—₱149 all-in na may drink!"

**Test hypothesis:** Variant B (free delivery framing) will outperform Variant A (no hidden fees) for price-sensitive students.

---

### Flash Sale (cold/slow delivery objection)

**Variant A:**  
"Delivered hot in 40 mins."

**Variant B:**  
"Hot pizza guarantee or free delivery on next order."

**Test hypothesis:** Variant B (guarantee framing) will reduce cart abandonment for office workers.

---

### Family Bundle (portion size objection)

**Variant A:**  
"Clear portions, no hidden fees."

**Variant B:**  
"Feeds 2–3 kids—perfect for family weekend!"

**Test hypothesis:** Variant B (feeds X people framing) will increase conversion for parents planning family meals.

