## Channel-specific best practices

### TikTok (Student Combo)
- Use trending audio + quick cuts (0:00–0:03 hook, 0:03–0:12 value prop, 0:12–0:18 CTA).  
- Nano-influencer collabs (0–10k followers) for higher relatability. [158][166]  
- Geo-fence campus areas for ad targeting.

### SMS/App Push (Flash Sale)
- Send at 3:15 PM (early window) and 5:00 PM (urgency window).  
- Include explicit end time ("Ends 6 PM") to drive urgency. [149][165]  
- Deep-link to landing page with live ETA calculator.

### Facebook/Parent Groups (Family Bundle)
- Post Friday 8 PM (dinner planning) and Saturday 10 AM (weekend meal prep).  
- Use actual portion photos + allergen/halal info in comments. [154][160]  
- Encourage parent group admins to share (micro-influencer effect). [161][166]

