## KPIs to track per variant

| Channel | Primary KPI | Secondary KPI | Objection metric |
|---|---|---|---|
| TikTok (Student) | CTR to app | Conversion rate (view → order) | Cart abandonment rate |
| SMS/App Push (Flash) | Redemption rate (code use) | Avg order value | ETA complaints (% of orders) |
| Facebook/Parent Groups (Family) | Click-to-order rate | Repeat order rate (30-day) | Portion size complaints (% of reviews) |

Use these variants to A/B test objection-handling, optimize channel mix, and refine ad copy based on behavioral response—not just demographics.

